{"id":"172355","t":{"th":"สืบลับฉบับคาโมโนะฮาชิ รอน ภาคที่ 2","ro":"Kamonohashi Ron no Kindan Suiri 2nd Season","en":"Ron Kamonohashi’s Forbidden Deductions Season 2","na":"鴨乃橋ロンの禁断推理 2nd Season"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx172355-D7J0LRyWZZhg.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx172355-D7J0LRyWZZhg.jpg","color":"#a1d6e4","banner":null,"fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":13,"dur":24,"season":"FALL","year":2024,"start":"2024-10-07","country":"JP","genres":["Drama","Mystery"],"score":75,"pop":24121,"studio":"diomedéa","desc":"Not long after forming their partnership, detectives Ron Kamonohashi and Totomaru Isshiki have proven adept at solving various cases together. However, the two are further motivated to continue their work when they discover that the House of M—an infamous crime syndicate—orchestrated Ron's expulsion from the prestigious Detective Training Academy BLUE five years prior. It appears that this group is also linked to Ron's mysterious ability that causes those around him to lose their lives, a phenomenon which Ron is desperate to stop.\n\nA member of the House of M soon starts to commit boastful serial murders around Shibuya as an act of provocation toward Ron. Consequently, the investigative pair must do their best to apprehend the culprit for the sake of justice as well as learning more about Ron's dark past and present condition.","descTh":"ไม่นานหลังจากก่อตั้งหุ้นส่วนกัน นักสืบรอน คาโมโนฮาชิและโทโทมารุ อิชิกิก็ได้พิสูจน์ให้เห็นถึงความสามารถในการไขคดีต่างๆ ร่วมกัน อย่างไรก็ตาม ทั้งสองมีแรงจูงใจมากขึ้นที่จะทำงานต่อไป เมื่อพวกเขาค้นพบว่า House of M ซึ่งเป็นองค์กรอาชญากรรมที่น่าอับอาย ได้จัดการขับไล่รอนออกจากสถาบันฝึกอบรมนักสืบอันทรงเกียรติ BLUE เมื่อห้าปีก่อน ดูเหมือนว่ากลุ่มนี้ยังเชื่อมโยงกับความสามารถลึกลับของรอนที่ทำให้คนรอบข้างเสียชีวิต ซึ่งเป็นปรากฏการณ์ที่รอนอยากจะหยุดยั้ง\n\nในไม่ช้า สมาชิกสภาเอ็มก็เริ่มก่อเหตุฆาตกรรมต่อเนื่องที่โอ้อวดรอบๆ ชิบูย่า เพื่อเป็นการยั่วยุรอน ด้วยเหตุนี้ คู่สืบสวนจึงต้องพยายามอย่างเต็มที่เพื่อจับกุมผู้กระทำผิดเพื่อความยุติธรรม ตลอดจนเรียนรู้เพิ่มเติมเกี่ยวกับสภาพอันมืดมนในอดีตและปัจจุบันของรอน","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"N5wbSJijLCA","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/172355","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/57635","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"anione_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_YV8EWtbQXHQuQKjgvTCuvYE5OenwjND","lang":"dub","eps":[["1","y:83II1S0GXvs",1761811057,"~m",null,"14",{"d":1430,"a":"members"}],["2","y:Hp2d_Jnh3FI",1761811057,"~m",null,"15",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["3","y:g14EdJguDvg",1761811057,"~m",null,"16",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["4","y:Z3yomYmUR4E",1761811057,"~m",null,"17",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["5","y:2zhzkhLMuug",1761811057,"~m",null,"18",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["6","y:gF75ywt2j0I",1761811057,"~m",null,"19",{"d":1430,"a":"members"}],["7","y:2xTJJeIOZd8",1761811057,"~m",null,"20",{"d":1430,"a":"members"}],["8","y:0l8k5FM_E6w",1761811057,"~m",null,"21",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["9","y:TAqLfzNd7Mg",1761811057,"~m",null,"22",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["10","y:fy2X98MQFkQ",1761811057,"~m",null,"23",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["11","y:mOcv32qj02I",1761811057,"~m",null,"24",{"d":1430,"a":"members"}],["12","y:yY2FlBLtOHA",1761811057,"~m",null,"25",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["13","y:nNOUcJ1ugbk",1761811057,"~m",null,"26",{"d":1461,"a":"members","fin":1}]],"pat":"ทุกวันพฤหัสบดี 19:00 น."},{"p":"anione_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_YV8EWtbQXHKTSqsPnjZMKEEApabtaOw","lang":"sub","eps":[["5","y:LsG9otuD2rQ",1761811057,"~m",null,"18",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["6","y:8-6UO4mmwBc",1761811057,"~m",null,"19",{"d":1430,"a":"members"}],["7","y:AKjbkJ1TW04",1761811057,"~m",null,"20",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["8","y:LKQPfiW-yt4",1761811057,"~m",null,"21",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["9","y:qEMPYAXraq4",1761811057,"~m",null,"22",{"d":1431,"a":"members"}],["10","y:R4TwGk9C4jw"